  "labeling_notes": {
    "relevant_sources": "URL substrings of the indexed pages that contain the answer. Page-level labels written by reading the pages in index.json; they were not produced by an independent annotator. An empty list means the index has no page that answers the question (transaction_decline_001), so the case is excluded from Precision/Recall/MRR and reported separately.",
    "required_facts": "Regular expressions (case-insensitive) that a correct answer must contain, derived from the deterministic mock customer data in main.users().",
    "split": "'dev' cases were used while building and tuning retrieval (stopwords, plural stemming, query lexicon). 'heldout' cases were written afterwards, labelled before the first run, and not used for any tuning. Report heldout numbers as the honest estimate."
  }
